# A Battle Hall singles challenge (decomp scripts_battle_hall.s, frontier_scripts_battle_hall.s): the single
# attendant, SINGLE, the party menu (PARTY_MENU_MODE_BATTLE_HALL: one Pokémon of level 30 or more), the save before
# the challenge (both questions YES), the corridor and the battle room (frontier scenes, the Pokémon on the stage),
# the type board: the first cell (Normal, rank 1), YES. The first battle won (the rank goes up, the Pokémon is
# restored), then RETIRE (YES): the save on the loss (BattleHall_SaveOnLoss: the board's ranks reset, the current and
# latest streak 1) and the species' win record (BattleHall_UpdateWinRecordForCurrentMon: Garchomp 1), the lobby's
# goodbye. The opponent is drawn from the game's RNG, so it differs by seed; the battle's result does not.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP 100 platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE platinum:MOVE_DRAGON_CLAW platinum:MOVE_FIRE_FANG platinum:MOVE_CRUNCH
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_BATTLE_HALL 7 9 left
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until menu 600
# SINGLE
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until app party 600
+2 screenshot hall-party
+2 tap slot:0
+2 tap menu:0
+2 tap confirm
until app none 300
advance text
until yesno 600
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until yesno 600
+2 press a
+1 release a
+300 press a
+1 release a
+120 screenshot hall-corridor
advance text 3000
until app hall-board 3000
+0 screenshot hall-board
+10 tap cell:0
+10 tap entry:0
until app none 300
+400 press a
+1 release a
+60 press a
+1 release a
until battle 3000
+0 screenshot hall-battle
battle auto 20000
until menu 3000
+0 screenshot hall-room
# RETIRE (the list's fourth)
+10 press down
+1 release down
+2 press down
+1 release down
+2 press down
+1 release down
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
until yesno 600
+2 press up
+1 release up
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
until idle 3000
advance text 3000
+0 assert battles frontier 1
+0 assert battle frontier * won single
+0 assert state frontier.hall.streaks[0] {"current":1,"latest":1,"species":"platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP"}
+0 assert state frontier.hall.records[0] {"platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP":1}
+0 assert state frontier.hall.active[0] false
